{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Roll her, squeeze her, feed her buns.&quot; t. incorrectlyrics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slap the network center button, enter a unique letter combination and convince your friends to roll this beauty up a tower. What is going on?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody knows!! Let\u2019s find out in this multiplayer jank fest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll-a-ball physics based multiplayer (or solo) gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncomplicated online networking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny sounds.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842980/extras/4c17047aaeb8e86c7d2fec41419929eb.poster.avif?t=1755589288\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842980/extras/4c17047aaeb8e86c7d2fec41419929eb.webm?t=1755589288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842980/extras/4c17047aaeb8e86c7d2fec41419929eb.mp4?t=1755589288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ferocious fiend has with forensic foresight fearlessly found our mistresses fatal flaw, every nightfall she falls fast asleep. She awakens confunded! For where am I?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frighteningly fresh this fanciful facility, with fragile falls in unforgiving forks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh look! This guy is talking, I should pay attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You roll a ball of water up a few levels, that's the game. Thank you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"congratulations!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/